{
  "version": 1,
  "_readme": [
    "Layouts are authored ONCE as ordered key lists. The grid mapping for landscape (5x3)",
    "and portrait (3x5) is derived from this order, so nothing here is duplicated per",
    "orientation.",
    "",
    "Each key: cmd = Fusion command id, label = text under the icon, match = the command's",
    "display name in Fusion (used by scripts/resolve-commands.js to re-resolve ids against a",
    "running Fusion -- ids are install-derived, never hand-invented).",
    "",
    "page = open a sub-page. view = set a viewport property (Fusion has no command for these).",
    "text = raw text command. peek = borrow another command's icon for a folder key.",
    "",
    "All 15 keys are context keys. Globals (Undo, Redo, View, Back) live in \"aux\" below, on",
    "the two side buttons and the dial."
  ],
  "aux": {
    "_note": "Undo and Redo sit on the two discrete side buttons, NOT on the dial: an encoder is easy to nudge while pressing it, and a stray rotation that silently undoes work is far worse than one that merely changes the camera. The dial gets the harmless job.",
    "buttons": [
      {
        "cmd": "UndoCommand",
        "label": "Undo",
        "match": "Undo"
      },
      {
        "cmd": "RedoCommand",
        "label": "Redo",
        "match": "Redo"
      }
    ],
    "dial": {
      "rotate": {
        "cycle": [
          {
            "view": "iso",
            "label": "Iso"
          },
          {
            "view": "top",
            "label": "Top"
          },
          {
            "view": "front",
            "label": "Front"
          }
        ]
      },
      "press": {
        "whenDialogOpen": {
          "text": "NuCommands.CommitCmd",
          "label": "OK"
        },
        "otherwise": {
          "nav": "home",
          "label": "Home"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "rules": [
    {
      "when": {
        "connected": false
      },
      "page": "disconnected"
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "dialogOpen": true,
        "inSketch": false
      },
      "page": "dialog",
      "whenNot": {
        "activeCommand": "SketchCreate"
      }
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "inSketch": true
      },
      "page": "sketch"
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "workspace": "FusionSolidEnvironment",
        "tab": "SurfaceTab"
      },
      "page": "surface"
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "workspace": "FusionSolidEnvironment",
        "tab": "ParaMeshOuterTab"
      },
      "page": "mesh"
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "workspace": "FusionSolidEnvironment",
        "tab": "SheetMetalTab"
      },
      "page": "sheetmetal"
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "workspace": "FusionSolidEnvironment"
      },
      "page": "solid"
    },
    {
      "when": {},
      "page": "home"
    }
  ],
  "pages": {
    "disconnected": {
      "title": "Fusion not running",
      "keys": [
        {
          "label": "Waiting for Fusion",
          "icon": "wait",
